# Component behaviors

Declare platform patterns on each component `schema.yml` under `behaviors:` — do not invent parallel keys (`variant_behaviors`, etc.).

| Id | When to declare |
|----|-----------------|
| `conversion` | field-editors include `form-settings` |
| `listing` | `dynamic_entries` / listing cards |
| `schema_org` | SSR JSON-LD contributor |
| `ecommerce` | funnel/catalog events or `cta-tracking` field-editors |

CTA ecommerce intent is **not** on behaviors. Bind paths with field-editor type `cta-tracking`. Required `cta.tracking`: `none` | `add_to_cart` | `begin_checkout`.

Save/MCP validate bound paths only (`validateCtaTracking` + `validateCtaPurchasable`). Non-`none` needs a purchasable product (`_ecommerce.yml`).

Catalog: `docs/component-behaviors.md`. MCP: `explain` topic `component-behaviors`. Schema-sync **preserves** `behaviors`.
